A||||2||william_thorniii||2nd Annual (Maybe Last) Fiero Swap Meet||||14||
Z||000000||william_thorniii||04-30-2000||11:07 PM||||Friends,<P>I just finished the near 1200 mile round trip to and from Ed & Rosie's place.  It was truly the time of my life.  The most fun for me was that I got to chat with some of the big names in Fiero's such as: George Ryan, Kevin Leslie, Dave K. (can't spell that well), Randy Agee, Mike Valentine, Ed Williams, Raydar, Paul McKibben, Rodney Dickman, Ashby, of course Ed Parks and countless others.  One thing is for sure, good times and good deals were had by all.  This is no doubt about it one of the best Fiero events this country has to offer.  I almost forgot to mention that I still have not stopped drooling after finally seeing some of my dream cars in person, such as Taz, Kevin Leslie's Northstar and George Ryan's Quad 4 Auto-X'er.  WOOOOOOW!<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||14
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||05-01-2000||12:20 AM||||Why (Maybe Last) ???||||reg||5
Z||000002||pherder||05-01-2000||07:17 PM||||Well, I just got back from my 1800 mile round trip and I am having trouble typing this!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I met a lot of Forum members but I got to say ... you all look taller in person!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>After carefully checking my finances ... I find that I sold my remanufactured gold 88 GT wheels and purchased a Getrag 5 speed, a whole bunch of little stuff from Rodney and some other "stuff" and about broke even (on the selling and buying).<P>I gave away two right side coupe rear tail lenses so two people are happier!<P>I got to pick the brain clean of the guy (Craig Brown) who built the PISA Artero which is my next winters' project.  Took a lot of pictures of the "details" on the car.  It was as beautiful in person as it looked on the picturepoint site!<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=236420&a=1757825&p=16540638&Sequence=0"> <P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=236420&a=1757825" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=236420&a=1757825</A> <P>I have already gotten a post on one of the Fiero lists that Ed will put on the third (and maybe last?) swap meed next year on the last weekend of April!<P>Paul||||reg||10
